# DungeonFighter balance tuning

Follow `Documentation/BALANCE_PROCESS.md` and `.claude/commands/balance.md`: scan (`Scripts/balance-scan.py`) →
focus (`Scripts/bo-solve.py` for clear rate, `Scripts/median-curve-solve.py` for fight length) → paired fresh-seed
confirm (`Scripts/dungeon-sim.py`) → gate (`Scripts/balance-check.ps1`). Balance is judged on real dungeons (HP carried
between fights, no post-fight heal), against `realClearAnchors` and `heroTurnsAnchors` in
`GameData/TuningProfiles/balance-targets.json`, never on single-fight win rate. Put changes in a new patch in
`GameData/Patches/Balance/` and ask before switching `GameData/PatchProfile.json`.
